CM_ "custom-pdm status messages (firmware NUM_TX_MSGS 38, msg n = base ID + 2 + n, Intel byte order, 8 bytes). Generated by ui/tools/DbcGen and the /pdm Export DBC button from the same code (ui/dingoConfig/domain/CustomPdm/DbcExport.cs): do not edit.";
CM_ BU_ A1 "custom-pdm board A, base ID 0x500";
